| **maskA | maskB**                  | Two masks    | Combined mask      | Merge masks                         |
| **~mask**                          | Mask         | Inverted mask      | Hit everything except these layers  |
| **mask & (1 << layer)**            | Mask + layer | Non-zero if inside | Check membership                    |
